  clock: 6  # 93bb
  nonce: 93bb  # 93bb
  message: "Merged in PR #1459 (dev ecbb226a0d).\n\nFixed in PR #1459, commit 5940353412. Behavioral evidence: on the item's own repro (getter, setter, `=>` body, auto-property initialiser, indexer, operator, conversion operator, destructor, event add/remove), analyze_csharp emits `A.Getter/A.Setter/A.Twice/A.AutoInit (property) -> A.Helper/Helper2`, `A.this[] (subscript)`, `A.operator+`, `A.operator int`, `A.~A` (method) and `A.Changed (event)` as the sources, and none from the class. `new B()` in a getter now emits `A.Made -instantiates-> B.B`; before, nothing was emitted. Production-path tests: `test_csharp_member_bodies.py` (7) and `test_ruby_csharp_call_anchor.py::test_csharp_member_bodies_are_anchored_on_their_member`. Both were red on 2a98abb55d and green after. A/B on the 8 C# corpus repos: 73 call sites re-anchored from class to member (54 property, 18 destructor, 1 operator==), +1 instantiates, 0 lost, containment violations 0 in both arms, property-sourced edges 0 -> 55. NOT asserted: field-initialiser object creation/method groups, local-function call resolution and field-like events (WI-sisuv); records (WI-kajoh); the Kotlin sibling (WI-rokir)."  # 93bb
